{#
    Email 06, "Your Lumen Forma has arrived" (Site v4 design, Llunio Email
    Templates/06-delivered.html), sent when the studio marks the order
    Delivered (Step 11.4): "Dear {first name}," (the buyer's), "Your Lumen
    Forma {sizes} lamp has been delivered. I hope it's found the perfect
    place in your home.", the request for a photo (Facebook or Instagram,
    @llunio_studios, or a reply) and "By sending me a photo, you're happy for
    me to share it." (wording decided 9 October 2026, replacing the design's
    sentence and its Share section; "I" by the voice rules, 15 October 2026), then "View your order". The design's
    "Care" section is left out until the care instructions are written
    (question 18). Laid out by email/_customer.html.twig.
#}
{% extends 'email/_customer.html.twig' %}
{% import 'email/_customer.html.twig' as layout %}

{% block title %}Your Lumen Forma has arrived{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}Your lamp has been delivered.{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<p style="{{ body }}">{{ order.deliveredSentence }}</p>
<p style="{{ body }}">Would you do me a small favour? I'd love to see where it ended up. Share a photo on Facebook or Instagram and tag Llunio Studios (@llunio_studios), or simply reply to this email with a picture. You might see it featured on our page.</p>
<p style="{{ body }}">By sending me a photo, you're happy for me to share it.</p>
{# Signed as the enquiry email (14 October 2026): after the opening, before the details. #}
{{ include('email/_signature.html.twig') }}
<div style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:1px;">&nbsp;</div>
{{ layout.button(url('order_view', { token: order.viewToken }), 'View your order') }}
<div style="height:24px;line-height:24px;font-size:1px;">&nbsp;</div>
<p style="{{ body }}">Reply to this email with any questions.</p>
{% endblock %}
